     1	//! Identity resolver for Phase 1 stable ids.
     2	//!
     3	//! This module implements the resolver deliverable required by
     4	//! `docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md`
     5	//! `## Phase 1: Unified Identity Model`. It also preserves the stable
     6	//! follow-up contract from
