//! Identity resolver for Phase 1 stable ids.
//!
//! This module implements the resolver deliverable required by
//! `docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md`
//! `## Phase 1: Unified Identity Model`. It also preserves the stable
//! follow-up contract from
//! `docs/architecture/2026-04-11-stable-follow-up-handles.md`
//! `## Contract` by preferring exact stable identities while still accepting
//! legacy name-based references.
//!
//! The small LRU cache is justified by
//! `docs/architecture/2026-04-11-stable-follow-up-handles.md`
//! `## Assistant-Facing Surfaces`, which calls out cached seeds and repeated
//! assistant-facing follow-up resolution as part of the contract.

